Please use the types in the src/Types/*.jl file. remember to include the folder @Types unless I tell you otherwise.
For new type definitions, please add them to the src/Types/*.jl file. The file name can be the module name under src/{module_name}/ or src/{module_name}.jl
Prefer not to create empty arrays and append! or push! to them. Instead, use map or other functional ways to create them all together.
Avoid for and while if no side effects are needed, use map, filter, reduce, etc.
Avoid set value by for/while each index, create all indices and set them together with .= or = 
Always have type hints.
Don't make try and catch unless I tell you explicitly to do so.
